{"title":"2022 CSMC Problems/Part A Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/9/f/a9fa1bed5a39a7f1bb51df05a92be20e211e759e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^{r} = 16$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"61\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/6/9/d6909f58065fbf50bb6d0eed4373f5f744919dd3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5^{s} = 25$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"60\" height=\"14\" />, what is the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/1/7/317440729faba2b233a3547c42e9baccad52b82d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r + s$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"39\" height=\"12\" />?\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/9/f/a9fa1bed5a39a7f1bb51df05a92be20e211e759e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^{r} = 16$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"61\" height=\"14\" /> when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/3/d/d3d0ec5f2d7f35713345f0d9428d964fb6d4525f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r = 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"44\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/6/9/d6909f58065fbf50bb6d0eed4373f5f744919dd3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5^{s} = 25$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"60\" height=\"14\" /> when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/0/e/d0e9607980bf6edb47c5b72623d1b1f86d148929.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s = 2$\" width=\"41\" height=\"12\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/c/f3cc222216a8b69109bdff96787edbfba644d83e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r + s = 4 + 2 = \\boxed{6}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"151\" height=\"25\" />.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_CSMC\" title=\"2022 CSMC\">2022 CSMC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_CSMC_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2022 CSMC Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_CSMC_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2022 CSMC Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b>First Problem</b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_2\" title=\"2022 CSMC Problems/Part A Problem 2\">Part A Problem 2</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Part A 1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_2\" title=\"2022 CSMC Problems/Part A Problem 2\">Part A 2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2022 CSMC Problems/Part A Problem 3 (page does not exist)\">Part A 3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2022 CSMC Problems/Part A Problem 4 (page does not exist)\">Part A 4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2022 CSMC Problems/Part A Problem 5 (page does not exist)\">Part A 5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2022 CSMC Problems/Part A Problem 6 (page does not exist)\">Part A 6</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_CSMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2022 CSMC Problems/Part B Problem 1 (page does not exist)\">Part B 1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_CSMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2022 CSMC Problems/Part B Problem 2 (page does not exist)\">Part B 2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_CSMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2022 CSMC Problems/Part B Problem 3 (page does not exist)\">Part B 3</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=CEMC_Senior_Competition\" title=\"CEMC Senior Competition\">CEMC Senior Competition</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018064317\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.016 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.024 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 84/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1240/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 137/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 1413/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n1